{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "ruin",
 "version": "1.0",
 "title": "RUIN",
 "description": "RUIN: a macro-only FOLD + CRUSH guest pack for the Digitone mk1. One master page, one right-edge amount bar, no full FX pages and no PERFORM. Encoder A toggles the macro, D cycles four mode pairings (TRASH + CRUNCH, CLEAN + REDUX, DIST + CRUNCH, MUD + BITS), B/C/E/F/G/H edit the amount. When off, the word RUIN scrolls right-to-left on a 4 px dot lattice; when on at 0 the page is the empty base lattice; above 0 it draws a mode-specific concentric-circle blast with shining rays. The FOLD and CRUSH settings are captured when the macro turns on and restored when it turns off. RUIN state is stored per pattern in one reserved MIDI track (CH 16, pattern+0x1BB0, magic ESO3). Requires the core (core-dn1 4.0) and the ESOTERIKA page host (esoterika); includes neither.",
 "category": "Sound",
 "author": "Digital Alchemy DSP",
 "license": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
 "target": {
  "device": "digitone-mk1",
  "product": "Digitone mk1",
  "os": "1.44",
  "syx_sha256": "d4f200d04484333d82822db7744e6484d0def8f2db8ddf55ee2b780cc13c9659",
